{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-06-21 00:01:00', 'title': "RTX'S COLLINS AEROSPACE BUSINESS SIGNS MRO AGREEMENT WITH ENVOY AIRLINES", 'text': "PARIS , JUNE 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PARIS AIR SHOW --\xa0RTX (NYSE: RTX) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COLLINS AEROSPACE BUSINESS HAS SIGNED A FLIGHTSENSE®\xa0FLIGHT-HOUR CONTRACT WITH ENVOY AIR. UNDER THE MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT, COLLINS WILL PROVIDE MAINTENANCE, REPAIR AND OVERHAUL (MRO) SERVICES FOR A NUMBER OF SYSTEMS ACROSS ENVOY'S FLEET OF 128 EMBRAER E175 AIRCRAFT."}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-06-20 18:25:00', 'title': 'US AIR FORCE AWARDS RTX $1.15 BILLION FOR LATEST AMRAAM CONFIGURATION', 'text': 'TUCSON, ARIZ. , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RTX (NYSE: RTX) WAS AWARDED A $1.15 BILLION CONTRACT FOR AIM-120 D-3 AND C-8 AMRAAM® MISSILES.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-06-20 02:30:00', 'title': 'JAPAN AIRLINES NOW USING RTX TO IMPROVE PREDICTIVE MAINTENANCE', 'text': 'COLLINS AEROSPACE ASCENTIA® TOOL TO BE INSTALLED ON OVER 50 AIRCRAFT\xa0 PARIS , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COLLINS AEROSPACE, AN RTX BUSINESS (NYSE: RTX), AND JAPAN AIRLINES (JAL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT JAL WILL USE COLLINS AEROSPACE\'S ASCENTIA® MAINTENANCE PERFORMANCE MONITORING SOLUTION ON ITS BOEING 787 FLEET. "ASCENTIA IS A VALUABLE ADDITION TO OUR MAINTENANCE PROGRAM," SAID HARADA KUNIHARU, MANAGER RELIABILITY GROUP, SYSTEM ENGINEERING OFFICE AT JAL ENGINEERING CO., LTD.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-06-20 01:30:00', 'title': 'SINGAPORE MANUFACTURING FACILITY PRODUCING CRITICAL PRATT & WHITNEY GTF™ ENGINE COMPONENTS ACHIEVES FULL OPERATIONAL CAPABILITY', 'text': "PARIS , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PARIS AIR SHOW -- PRATT & WHITNEY, AN RTX (NYSE: RTX) BUSINESS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS SINGAPORE MANUFACTURING FACILITY, WHICH PRODUCES CRITICAL COMPONENTS FOR PRATT & WHITNEY'S GTF™ ENGINE FAMILY, HAS ACHIEVED FULL OPERATIONAL CAPABILITY. AS PART OF PRATT & WHITNEY'S OVERALL INDUSTRY 4.0 STRATEGY, THE FACILITY ADOPTED WALL-TO-WALL CLOSED-DOOR MACHINING WHILE ACTIVELY INTEGRATING THE LATEST TECHNOLOGY AND AUTOMATION INTO THE MANUFACTURING PROCESS."}